aped lot, featuring 4 bedrooms and 4 bathrooms. The main floor offers a spacious family area and an impressive open-to-below living room with a feature wall, three-sided fireplace and built-in cabinetry. The dining area includes a wet bar, while the kitchen features a modern modular kitchen and separate spice kitchen. A main-floor bedroom and full bathroom add flexibility for guests or family. Upstairs are a bonus room, two primary bedrooms with private ensuites—one 5-piece and one 3-piece—and an additional bedroom with two closets. A separate 3-piece bathroom serves the additional bedroom. The convenient upper-floor laundry includes a sink and cabinetry. A separate side entrance offers potential for future development. With generous living spaces and a thoughtful layout, this home is ideal for families seeking comfort, style and functionality. A thoughtful layout offers comfortable living, entertaining and room to unwind! (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$789,000"],["Type","House"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","4"],["Living area","2,634 sq ft"],["Year built","2026"],["Storeys","2"],["Neighbourhood","The Orchards At Ellerslie"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6X3L2"],["MLS® number","E4517540"],["Listed","November 25, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Hood Fan, Garage door opener, Garage door opener remote(s)"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Unfinished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Family room","Main level",""],["Primary Bedroom","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 2","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 3","Upper Level",""],["Bedroom 4","Main level",""],["Bonus Room","Upper Level",""],["Laundry room","Upper Level",""]],"courtesy":"Jappy Juneja, RE/MAX Excellence and Amrit Deol, RE/MAX Excellence","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"the-orchards-at-ellerslie","area":"southeast-edmonton"}